{"id":66668,"date":"2025-08-29T08:24:37","date_gmt":"2025-08-29T07:24:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=66668"},"modified":"2026-09-06T12:59:43","modified_gmt":"2026-09-06T11:59:43","slug":"rfm-performance-manz-games","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/rfm-performance-manz-games\/","title":{"rendered":"RFM Performance MANZ Games 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">RFM Performance MANZ Games 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O RFM Performance MANZ Games \u00e9 uma competi\u00e7\u00e3o pioneira em Portugal que combina o treino de corrida com exerc\u00edcios funcionais de for\u00e7a e resist\u00eancia. Inspirado no conceito internacional de fitness racing, o evento foi desenhado para ser acess\u00edvel, inclusivo e altamente desafiante para praticantes de fitness e amantes da corrida.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A din\u00e2mica consiste em percorrer um total de 4.200 metros de corrida divididos em 7 voltas de 600 metros, sendo cada volta intercalada por uma esta\u00e7\u00e3o de treino funcional de alta exig\u00eancia: Remo Concept2 (1.000m), Slam Ball Throw (4x10m), Kettlebell Farmer Carry (200m), SkiErg Concept2 (1.000m), Dumbbell Walking Lunges (100m), Burpees Broad Jump (100m) e Wall Ball (100 repeti\u00e7\u00f5es).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com cronometragem oficial eletr\u00f3nica com chip a cargo da Lap2Go, a prova disputa-se no emblem\u00e1tico Complexo Desportivo Municipal 1\u00ba de Maio (INATEL) em Lisboa, com divis\u00f5es Singles (individuais), Duplas e Estafetas de 4 atletas.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">5 e 6 de Setembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"displ